title: 'News only, or settled: 14 messages.'
pid: 02e725c6-d741-4049-971b-09e660e5da98
body: |2-
  Builds announced and finished, restarts to do, notes written. From
  2026-11-12: 07:45, "night", 10:25 (his notes on using a graph), 10:28,
  10:35 (the hiding habit, which he now uses), 22:20 (his config
  switch, which his server shows he made). From 2026-11-13: 04:46,
  06:15 (its default was built), 07:15, 07:44, 08:03, 09:13. From
  2026-11-14: 09:05, 16:10. The other three of the 17 are below:
  the superseded 08:55, 'Say "build it"', and the 06:33 index.
